#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:2
msgid "Manage your security preferences"
msgstr "보안 환경설정 관리"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""
"|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Professional, Enterprise 및 Enterprise Advanced "
"플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:7
msgid ""
"Select your profile picture, select **Profile**, and then select "
"**Security** to configure your password, view access history, and to view"
" or logout of active sessions."
msgstr ""
"프로필 사진을 선택하고 **Profile**\\ 을 선택한 다음 **Security**\\ 를 선택해 "
"비밀번호를 구성하고, 접근 기록을 보고, 활성 세션을 보거나 로그아웃합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:10
msgid "**Security setting**"
msgstr "**보안 설정**"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:10
msgid "**Description**"
msgstr "**설명**"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:12
msgid "Password"
msgstr "비밀번호"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:12
msgid ""
"You may change your password if you've logged in by email using "
"Mattermost in a web browser or using the desktop app."
msgstr ""
"웹 브라우저나 데스크톱 앱에서 OKR.BEST를 사용해 이메일로 로그인한 경우 "
"비밀번호를 변경할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:17
msgid ""
"If you sign in to Mattermost using a single sign-on service, you must "
"update your password through your SSO service account."
msgstr ""
"Single Sign-On 서비스를 사용해 OKR.BEST에 로그인하는 경우 SSO 서비스 계정을 "
"통해 비밀번호를 업데이트해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Password Security Enhancement**: From v11.0, Mattermost uses PBKDF2 "
"password hashing for improved security. When you log in after your server"
" upgrades to v11.0+, your password will be automatically migrated to the "
"more secure format. If your server is later downgraded to a version prior"
" to v11.0, you may be unable to log in and will need to contact your "
"system administrator for a password reset."
msgstr ""
"**비밀번호 보안 강화**: v11.0부터 OKR.BEST는 보안 향상을 위해 PBKDF2 비밀번호 "
"해싱을 사용합니다. 서버가 v11.0 이상으로 업그레이드된 후 로그인하면 비밀번호가 "
"자동으로 더 안전한 형식으로 마이그레이션됩니다. 이후 서버가 v11.0보다 낮은 "
"버전으로 다운그레이드되면 로그인하지 못할 수 있으며, 비밀번호 재설정을 위해 "
"시스템 관리자에게 문의해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:25
msgid "Multi-factor authentication (MFA)"
msgstr "다단계 인증(MFA)"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:25
msgid ""
"If your system admin has enabled :ref:`multi-factor authentication "
"<administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-"
"settings:enable multi-factor authentication>` (MFA), you can require a "
"passcode in addition to your password to log-in to your Mattermost "
"account."
msgstr ""
"시스템 관리자가 :ref:`다단계 인증 <administration-guide/configure"
"/authentication-configuration-settings:enable multi-factor "
"authentication>`(MFA)을 활성화한 경우, OKR.BEST 계정에 로그인할 때 비밀번호 "
"외에 패스코드를 요구하도록 할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:29
msgid ""
"You'll need to download a MFA passcode generation app, such as Google "
"Authenticator or a similar app, and then set-up MFA in your Mattermost "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Google Authenticator 같은 MFA 패스코드 생성 앱이나 유사한 앱을 다운로드한 다음 "
"OKR.BEST 계정에서 MFA를 설정해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:32
msgid "**Download a passcode generation app**"
msgstr "**패스코드 생성 앱 다운로드**"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:34
msgid ""
"Download Google Authenticator for an Apple device from `iTunes "
"<https://apps.apple.com/us/app/google-authenticator/id388497605>`_"
msgstr ""
"Apple 기기용 Google Authenticator를 `iTunes "
"<https://apps.apple.com/us/app/google-authenticator/id388497605>`_\\ 에서 "
"다운로드합니다"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:36
msgid ""
"Download Google Authenticator for an Android device from `Google Play "
"<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.google. "
"android.apps.authenticator2&hl=en>`__"
msgstr ""
"Android 기기용 Google Authenticator를 `Google Play "
"<https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.google. "
"android.apps.authenticator2&hl=en>`__\\ 에서 다운로드합니다"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:40
msgid "**Enable MFA in Mattermost**"
msgstr "**OKR.BEST에서 MFA 활성화**"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:42
msgid "Open Mattermost in a web browser or the desktop app."
msgstr "웹 브라우저나 데스크톱 앱에서 OKR.BEST를 엽니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:43
msgid "In Mattermost, from your profile picture, select **Profile > Security**."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 프로필 사진에서 **Profile > Security**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:44
msgid "Under **Multi-factor Authentication**, select **Edit**."
msgstr "**Multi-factor Authentication** 아래에서 **Edit**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:46
msgid "Enable multi-factor authentication through your Mattermost user profile."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 사용자 프로필을 통해 다단계 인증을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:49
msgid "Select **Add MFA to Account**."
msgstr "**Add MFA to Account**\\ 를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:51
msgid "Add multi-factor authentication to your Mattermost user profile."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 사용자 프로필에 다단계 인증을 추가합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:54
msgid ""
"Scan the QR code or enter the **Secret** provided by Mattermost into the "
"authenticator app."
msgstr ""
"QR 코드를 스캔하거나 OKR.BEST가 제공하는 **Secret**\\ 을 인증 앱에 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:55
msgid "In Mattermost, enter the **MFA Code** generated by the authenticator app."
msgstr "OKR.BEST에서 인증 앱이 생성한 **MFA Code**\\ 를 입력합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:56
msgid "Select **Save**."
msgstr "**저장**\\ 을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:58
msgid "Sign-in method"
msgstr "로그인 방법"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:58
msgid ""
"This option allows you to switch your login method between using "
"email/username and password and :ref:`single sign-on credentials <end-"
"user-guide/access/access-your-workspace:single sign-on (sso)>`."
msgstr ""
"이 옵션을 사용하면 이메일/사용자 ID와 비밀번호 사용과 :ref:`Single Sign-On "
"자격 증명 <end-user-guide/access/access-your-workspace:single sign-on "
"(sso)>` 사용 사이에서 로그인 방법을 전환할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:61
msgid ""
"You can configure this setting using Mattermost in a web browser or using"
" the desktop app."
msgstr ""
"이 설정은 웹 브라우저나 데스크톱 앱에서 OKR.BEST를 사용해 구성할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:65
msgid ""
"While you can choose to log in with either set of credentials, you can "
"only enable one login method at a time. For example, if AD/LDAP single "
"sign-on is enabled, you can select **Switch to using AD/LDAP**, and enter"
" your AD/LDAP credentials to switch login over to AD/LDAP. You'll need to"
" enter the password for your email account to verify your existing "
"credentials. Following the change, you'll receive an email to confirm the"
" action."
msgstr ""
"두 가지 자격 증명 중 하나로 로그인하도록 선택할 수 있지만, 한 번에 하나의 "
"로그인 방법만 활성화할 수 있습니다. 예를 들어 AD/LDAP Single Sign-On이 "
"활성화된 경우 **Switch to using AD/LDAP**\\ 를 선택하고 AD/LDAP 자격 증명을 "
"입력해 로그인을 AD/LDAP로 전환할 수 있습니다. 기존 자격 증명을 확인하려면 "
"이메일 계정의 비밀번호를 입력해야 합니다. 변경 후에는 동작을 확인하는 이메일을 "
"받습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:71
msgid "View access history"
msgstr "접근 기록 보기"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:71
msgid ""
"Using Mattermost in a browser or using the desktop app, you can access a "
"chronological list of the last 20 login and logout attempts, channel "
"creations and deletions, account settings changes, or channel setting "
"modifications made with your account."
msgstr ""
"브라우저나 데스크톱 앱에서 OKR.BEST를 사용해, 자신의 계정으로 수행된 최근 "
"20건의 로그인·로그아웃 시도, 채널 생성·삭제, 계정 설정 변경, 채널 설정 수정을 "
"시간순으로 정렬한 목록에 접근할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:75
msgid ""
"The details of the Session ID, which is a unique identifier for each "
"Mattermost browser session, and IP Address of the action is recorded for "
"audit log purposes."
msgstr ""
"각 OKR.BEST 브라우저 세션의 고유 식별자인 세션 ID와 동작의 IP 주소 세부 정보가 "
"감사 로그 용도로 기록됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:78
msgid "View and log out of active sessions"
msgstr "활성 세션 보기 및 로그아웃"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:78
msgid ""
"Sessions are created when you log in with your credentials a new browser "
"on a device. Sessions let you use Mattermost for up to 30 days without "
"having to log in again."
msgstr ""
"세션은 기기의 새 브라우저에서 자격 증명으로 로그인할 때 생성됩니다. 세션을 "
"통해 다시 로그인하지 않고도 최대 30일 동안 OKR.BEST를 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:81
msgid "Using Mattermost in a browser or using the desktop app:"
msgstr "브라우저나 데스크톱 앱에서 OKR.BEST를 사용할 때:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:83
msgid ""
"Select **Logout** during an active session if you want to revoke "
"automatic login privileges for a specific browser or device."
msgstr ""
"특정 브라우저나 기기에 대한 자동 로그인 권한을 취소하려면 활성 세션 중에 "
"**Logout**\\ 을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences.rst:85
msgid "Select **More Info** to view browser and system details."
msgstr "**More Info**\\ 를 선택해 브라우저와 시스템 세부 정보를 봅니다."

